    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**SITE A WITH FULL PLANNING PERMISSION**\r\n\r\nAn opportunity to create a distinctive contemporary home in an established residential setting at Avondale Park, off Killiney Road, Dalkey.\r\n\r\nAvalon’s proposed accommodation extends to approximately 210 m² over three levels. The ground floor centres on a generous open-plan kitchen, dining and family space, complemented by a separate living room, utility room and guest WC. Off-street parking further enhances the practical appeal of the home. Great sea views to Dun Laoghaire and Howth. Off street Parking. \r\n\r\nThe first floor provides a principal bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite, two further bedrooms, a family bathroom and a dedicated study. A fourth bedroom suite has an en-suite and walk in wardrobe and roof terrace complete the upper level, adding flexibility for guests or family living.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary exterior combines clean architectural lines, timber detailing and substantial glazing. With an anticipated A-rated energy specification, Avalon offers the opportunity to tailor a new home’s interiors and finishes to individual tastes.\r\n\r\nSite offered with planning permission under reference D25A/0792. The asking price is for the site; construction costs are additional.\r\n\r\nLink to Site B: https://www.myhome.ie/residential/brochure/avalon-avondale-park-killiney-county-dublin/5028734\r\nLink to Coonawarra (Main House):  https://www.myhome.ie/residential/brochure/coonawarra-38-killiney-road-dalkey-county-dublin/5028749"
      },
